      "label": "Git Workflow",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": ".fallow/agile-workflow.md",
      "rationale": "Feature branch workflow with protected main/develop branches, conventional commits, PR requirements (approval + CI checks)"
    },
    {
      "id": "fallow_agile_workflow_ci_cd",
      "label": "CI/CD Pipeline",
